    {
      "id": "Asum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1220.0,
      "y": 580.0,
      "width": 665.0,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2267,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2274,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE: accept once (key UNIQUE) -> Kafka 'notifications' -> router:\n1 preferences, opt-outs, quiet hours (defer marketing)\n2 frequency caps (e.g. 5 marketing pushes / user / day)\n3 render the template per channel + language\n-> Kafka by CHANNEL -> one worker pool per channel -> provider.\nEach worker: provider rate limit, retries with backoff, dead-letter\nafter N tries; Deliveries (notif, channel) UNIQUE stops duplicates.\n\nREAD: status per channel from Deliveries; in-app inbox by userId.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE: accept once (key UNIQUE) -> Kafka 'notifications' -> router:\n1 preferences, opt-outs, quiet hours (defer marketing)\n2 frequency caps (e.g. 5 marketing pushes / user / day)\n3 render the template per channel + language\n-> Kafka by CHANNEL -> one worker pool per channel -> provider.\nEach worker: provider rate limit, retries with backoff, dead-letter\nafter N tries; Deliveries (notif, channel) UNIQUE stops duplicates.\n\nREAD: status per channel from Deliveries; in-app inbox by userId.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
