      "originalText": "ONE TOPIC FOR EVERYTHING (no priority lanes): campaign batches and transactional sends share the\n'notifications' topic and the same workers. The campaign throttle (~30k/s) keeps the campaign from taking all\nthe capacity; trade-off: an OTP sent mid-campaign can wait behind batches already queued (seconds with the cap).\nThe kill switch (campaign status = cancelled) is checked per batch: stop within seconds.",
